<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-lewis-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Lewis (2003) zebrafish her1/her7 autoinhibitory delay differential oscillator and DeltaC-Notch synchronization (Danio rerio (zebrafish presomitic mesoderm & paraxial somites))",
        "Lewis (2003) zebrafish her1/her7 autoinhibitory delay differential oscillator and DeltaC-Notch synchronization faithfully reproduces Danio rerio (zebrafish presomitic mesoderm & paraxial somites) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/lewis-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/lewis-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/lewis-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2003-lewis-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Danio rerio (zebrafish presomitic mesoderm & paraxial somites) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 90.8/100, audit 2026-10-19-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2003-lewis-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator.py> ;
    schema:about "Danio rerio (zebrafish presomitic mesoderm & paraxial somites)" ;
    schema:additionalProperty "does_not_claim: Full 2D spatial traveling kinematic phase waves with Doppler tailbud shortening or explicit Hes6 heterodimer stoichiometry",
        "reconstructed_in_script: 32-cell stochastic PSM phase-oscillator ensemble reproducing wild-type Notch-coupled synchrony (R_sync = 0.9840, 14/14 intact somites) vs Notch mutant desynchronization after 6 intact anterior somites (late R_sync = 0.2316)",
        "reconstructed_in_script: 4th-order Runge-Kutta method-of-steps DDE integrator verifying total delay invariance (T_m - delta, T_p + delta), Hopf threshold T_crit = 7.54 min, subcritical intron-deletion damping (0 late peaks), and cycloheximide arrest (a=0 -> m*=143.5 molecules)",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Bilateral dorsal somite row DoG peak and inter-somitic cleft segmentation on zebrafish_somites_specimen.jpg (48.47 px mean spacing, symmetry ratio 0.9605)",
        "reported_in_source: Lewis (2003) Current Biology 13:1398-1408 single-cell her1/her7 delay differential equations dp/dt = a m(t - T_p) - b p(t) and dm/dt = k / (1 + (p(t - T_m)/p_0)^n) - c m(t)",
        "reported_in_source: Supercritical Hopf bifurcation threshold T_tot = T_m + T_p > T_crit, oscillation period rule T_osc ~ 2*(T_m + T_p + tau_p + tau_m) ~ 30 min at 28 C, and DeltaC-Notch synchronization vs bea/des/aei mutant desynchronization after 5-7 anterior somites",
        "transfer_boundary: Single-cell her1/her7 DDE and 1D stochastic Kuramoto-Notch PSM chain mapped to dorsal vertebrate SEM somite metameres" ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2003-lewis-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator.py; output: docs/media/her1_her7_delayed_oscillator_comparison.png; organism: Danio rerio (zebrafish presomitic mesoderm & paraxial somites); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: aac320679fac08d48974a97790e40f0dc67f5f375d8c0e064bf33e9bb39965c7; artifact_sha256: 0e1ad609466f9bb60c1a445eb6803998bd157f8317975fa758496ed2cb2aa073; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/her1_her7_delayed_oscillator/her1_her7_delayed_oscillator_reference.json=5c4993acb1c42c84..., datasets/her1_her7_delayed_oscillator/scout_manifest.json=ebe3f2cee38772dd..., datasets/her1_her7_delayed_oscillator/zebrafish_somites_specimen.jpg=8b80971796cb29e2...}; supersedes_audit_id: 2026-10-19-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator-audit; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Lewis (2003) Current Biology 13:1398-1408 single-cell her1/her7 delay differential equations dp/dt = a m(t - T_p) - b p(t) and dm/dt = k / (1 + (p(t - T_m)/p_0)^n) - c m(t) | Supercritical Hopf bifurcation threshold T_tot = T_m + T_p > T_crit, oscillation period rule T_osc ~ 2*(T_m + T_p + tau_p + tau_m) ~ 30 min at 28 C, and DeltaC-Notch synchronization vs bea/des/aei mutant desynchronization after 5-7 anterior somites; reconstructed_in_script: 4th-order Runge-Kutta method-of-steps DDE integrator verifying total delay invariance (T_m - delta, T_p + delta), Hopf threshold T_crit = 7.54 min, subcritical intron-deletion damping (0 late peaks), and cycloheximide arrest (a=0 -> m*=143.5 molecules) | 32-cell stochastic PSM phase-oscillator ensemble reproducing wild-type Notch-coupled synchrony (R_sync = 0.9840, 14/14 intact somites) vs Notch mutant desynchronization after 6 intact anterior somites (late R_sync = 0.2316) | Bilateral dorsal somite row DoG peak and inter-somitic cleft segmentation on zebrafish_somites_specimen.jpg (48.47 px mean spacing, symmetry ratio 0.9605); transfer_boundary: Single-cell her1/her7 DDE and 1D stochastic Kuramoto-Notch PSM chain mapped to dorsal vertebrate SEM somite metameres; does_not_claim: Full 2D spatial traveling kinematic phase waves with Doppler tailbud shortening or explicit Hes6 heterodimer stoichiometry]" ;
    pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0960-9822(03)00534-7>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cub.2010.06.034>,
